48	    Should have 3 or 4 channels.
49	 table_channels - number of channels in the lookup table, 3 or 4.
50	    Should be less or equal than number of channels in imOut image;
51	 size1D, size_2D and size3D - dimensions of provided table;
52	 table - flat table,
53	    array with table_channels * size1D * size2D * size3D elements,
54	    where channels are changed first, then 1D, then 2D, then 3D.
